# ESLint

- Import order (`simple-import-sort`):
  1. react / next
  2. external packages
  3. `@/app`
  4. `@/providers`
  5. `@/endpoints`
  6. `@/components`
  7. `@/features`
  8. `@/hooks`
  9. `@/lib`
  10. `@/db`
  11. other `@/`
  12. relative (`../` and `./`)
  13. styles (`*.css`)
- `function Name()` declarations (not `const Name = () =>` for components/helpers covered by `func-style`).
- JSX props: shorthand first, multiline last, callbacks last (`react/jsx-sort-props`).
- Scripts: `pnpm lint` · `pnpm lint:fix`.
